# CODEOWNERS — who reviews what.
#
# The single rule below covers every file: one owner, one review required.
# `OWNER` is the repository owner and the only account with write
# access, so it is the only handle that can actually be asked for a review.
#
# Replace it with a team or a second maintainer the moment one exists. A
# CODEOWNERS file that names nobody valid silently asks nobody.
* @OWNER
#
# Component mappings (uncomment and fill in when more than one owner exists):
# /backend/ @maintainer
# /frontend/ @maintainer
# /gateway/ @maintainer
# /docs/ @maintainer
# /.github/ @maintainer